sequenceDiagram
    participant TC as Transport Company
    participant CT as Control Tower
    participant DC as Distribution Center
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    CT->>DC: POST /orders (new_order with handling times)
    DC->>DC: Plan staging, reserve a dock slot, and persist schedule
    DC-->>CT: 200 new_order_response
    CT->>TC: Relay dock and planned times
    Note over DC: Stage goods before arrival when feasible
    loop ETA changes before arrival
        CT->>MQ: Publish to dc.1.arrival.update
        MQ-->>DC: incoming_order_update (arrival_time_at_dc)
        DC->>DC: Recalculate schedule as needed
        opt Schedule changed
            DC->>MQ: Publish to ct.1.schedule.update
            MQ-->>CT: outgoing_order_update
            CT->>TC: Relay updated schedule
        end
    end
    CT->>MQ: Publish to dc.1.arrival.actual
    MQ-->>DC: actual_arrival (actual_arrival_time_at_dc)
    DC->>DC: Recalculate schedules for the arriving order and any other affected orders
    loop For each order whose schedule changed after actual arrival
        DC->>MQ: Publish to ct.1.schedule.update
        MQ-->>CT: outgoing_order_update (affected order_id)
        CT->>TC: Relay updated schedule to the relevant TC
    end
    DC->>DC: Load only after confirmed arrival, staging completion, and dock availability
    DC->>MQ: Publish to ct.1.loading.confirmation
    MQ-->>CT: outgoing_loading_confirmation
    Note over CT: Wait for loading confirmations for all orders on this truck at this DC
    opt CT authorizes onward movement
        CT->>TC: Authorize departure
    end
